  headline: The Flour Fields
  article: 'Our heroes returned from their quest to rid us of the scarecrow scourge,
    but with bundles of grain, not miracle flowers, in hand. The scent of the delicious
    grain has calmed the scarecrows, and they agree to go back to their homeland
    and leave us be.


    As a parting gift, they left <i>"these weird stuffed dolls
    on sticks"</i> in their place.'
